{
  "title": "Lightly Smoked Norwegian Fish Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting Norwegian fish stew with a smoky flavor, featuring Chinese five spice powder and macrobiotic-friendly ingredients, perfect for a sick day",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
  "diet": [
